5. Keep the same approximate length (±10% max).
6. Keep natural spoken language suitable for a short-form creator.
7. Do not add hashtags, captions, camera directions, or any explanation.
8. Output ONLY the revised script in this exact format (no extra text, no emojis in headings):

FINAL SCRIPT

HOOK
<one hook line>

FULL SPOKEN SCRIPT
[0-5s] ...
(continue with approximate timestamps as needed)

CTA
<one CTA line>

If the user's request is unclear or too broad (e.g. "make it better", "change the flow"), make the smallest possible improvements while keeping almost everything the same.`;

const USER =
  'PREVIOUS SCRIPT:\n<<<SCRIPT_START>>>\n' +
  prev.slice(0, 6000) +
  '\n<<<SCRIPT_END>>>\n\n' +
  'USER REVISION REQUEST:\n<<<REQUEST_START>>>\n' +
